{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n\n<p>發佈時間：14:01 2026-11-24 HKT</p>\n<img alt=\"Tesla及SpaceX據報任命5名董事負責合併談判\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/8475c9b9c695c7051c100a79c6fe3240/2026-11/__template3_-_2023-01-16T143801_586.png\"/>\n<p>據外媒引述消息報道，馬斯克（Elon Musk）旗下兩家上市公司已任命5名董事，負責處理合併談判的特別委員會，其中3人來自Tesla、2人則來自SpaceX。</p>\n<p>報道指出，上述5名董事包括來自SpaceX的Roelof Botha和Randy Glein，以及來自Tesla的Robyn Denholm、Kathleen Wilson-Thompson和Jack Hartung。</p>\n<p>Tesla（TSLA）及SpaceX（SPCX）周一股價隨大市反彈，分別升11.5%及4.4%，收報385.46美元及133.35美元。</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-24T06:35:01.580154+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":284,"images":1,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-24T06:01:47+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-24T10:17:30.108968+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-24T06:28:25.708434+00:00","content_hash":"2de63f3a7796e5b0e759a518f94944745249a83abd091e2069eda9eb00a4a7c2","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}